GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 32. Get User by ID (SUPER_ADMIN or AGENCY_ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


